@startuml
title Stock Lending and Repos Control Record - BIAN UML
' Generated from BIAN Control Record diagram for machine-readable context
' Service Domain: Stock Lending and Repos
' Source: https://bian.org/servicelandscape-14-0-0/views/view_40922.html
' Extraction: SVG semantic extraction (svg_to_puml_control_record)
' Annotation legend:
'   <<datatype>>            -> the SVG marks this shape as UML_DataType (not a plain class)
'   BianBom: yes            -> this class/enum/datatype sits inside the SVG's
'                              dashed "BIAN BOM" grouping box
'   Extensible: yes/no      -> from the class box border color in the SVG:
'                              red border only (fill #eae8e8 / stroke #c47474) = yes,
'                              this class's attributes MAY be pulled into this
'                              diagram from its owning Service Domain if needed;
'                              fully red (fill #ff8080 / stroke #d91616) = no,
'                              extending it is not allowed. Absent = plain
'                              class (fill #ffffff / stroke #d9d9d9), not part
'                              of this distinction.
'   BQ: <name>              -> Behavior Qualifier note linked to this class
'   AssetType: <name>       -> AssetType note linked to this class
'   ControlRecord: <name>   -> ControlRecord note linked to this class
'   GenericArtifact: <name> -> GenericArtifact note linked to this class
'   HelperDiagram: <name>   -> local BOM helper-diagram box named "<Class> Helper Diagram"
'   BOMDiagram: <name>      -> cross-service-domain BOM diagram box named "<Class> BOM Diagram"
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

class "CR Repo Transaction Instance Record" as N275556 {
  + Repo Transaction Parameter Type : FeatureTypeValues
  + Repo Transaction Selected Option : Service
  + Repo Transaction Status : TransactionStatus
  + Repo Transaction Type : RepurchaseTypeValues
  + Repo Transaction Reference : Repo Transaction
  + Repurchase Agreement Reference : Repurchase Agreement
  + Repurchase Agreement Involved Party Reference : InvolvedParty
  + Repurchase Agreement Involvement Type : RepurchaseAgreementInvolvementTypeValues
  + Repurchase Arrangement Reference : Repo Arrangement
}

class "BQ Repo Transaction Security Transfer Instance Record" as N275567 {
  + Preconditions : Condition
  + Schedule : Schedule
  + Business Service : Business Service
  + Postconditions : Condition
  + Repo Transaction Reference : Transaction
  + Repo Transaction Security Transfer Task Reference : Task
  + Repo Transaction Security Transfer Task Type : Text
}

class "BQ Repo Transaction Initiation Instance Record" as N275577 {
  + Preconditions : Condition
  + Schedule : Schedule
  + Business Service : Business Service
  + Postconditions : Condition
  + Repo Transaction Reference : Transaction
  + Repo Transaction Initiation Task Reference : Task
  + Repo Transaction Initiation Task Type : Text
}

class "BQ Repo Transaction Cash Transfer Instance Record" as N275585 {
  + Preconditions : Condition
  + Schedule : Schedule
  + Business Service : Business Service
  + Postconditions : Condition
  + Repo Transaction Reference : Transaction
  + Repo Transaction Cash Transfer Task Reference : Task
  + Repo Transaction Cash Transfer Task Type : Text
}

class "Stock Lending and Repos" as N275594 {
}
note right of N275594
  BOMDiagram: Stock Lending and Repos BOM Diagram
end note

